  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Sandevistan<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Sandevistan Operating System. The Sandevistan can be activated as half of a ROF 2 Action and lasts 9 seconds (3 Rounds). For those 3 Rounds, alongside the usual +3 initiative, the user may take their Move Action, and only that, as though they were first in the initiative queue whatever they rolled, which lets them move ahead of Demons and Vehicles. A Solo may also reassign their Combat Awareness Points without an Action whenever they make an Aimed Shot, use an Alternate Firing Mode, or resolve a Martial Arts Special Move while it is active.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Every Operating System is incompatible with every other Operating System and with the base cyberware it is for: none of them can be installed while another OS, or that OS's own base cyberware, is anywhere in the user's body or in a worn apparatus they're connected to. The sheet doesn't enforce that.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Operating Systems &gt; Sandevistan Operating Systems).</em></p>"
